# Secret Buried in the Swamp (Q031): a level 66 character accepts at Abercrombie, finds Krorin's
# journal on the dwarf's corpse, reports, then visits the four forgotten monuments in order (a
# monument out of turn is silent, a visited one answers it is done); Abercrombie takes the journal
# for adena and experience and the quest completes; then relog. Expectations replay the reference
# trace of this scenario.
